{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-28-1","title":"Psalms 28:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David prays earnestly against his enemies; 6 and for the people.</p>\n<p>Unto. 3:4; 5:2; 22:2; 77:1; 142:1 O. 18:2; 42:9; Isa 26:4; *marg: be. 35:22; 83:1 to. Heb. from. I become. 30:9; 69:15; 88:4-6; 143:7; Job 33:28; Pr 1:12; Isa 38:18; Re 20:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-2","title":"Psalms 28:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>when. 63:4; 125:5; 134:2; 141:2; 143:6; 2Ch 6:13; 1Ti 2:8 thy holy oracle. or, the oracle of thy sanctuary. 5:7; 138:2; 1Ki 6:19,22,23; 8:6-8,28-30,38; Da 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-3","title":"Psalms 28:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Draw. 26:9; Nu 16:26; Mt 25:41,46 speak. 12:2; 55:21; 62:4; Jer 9:8,9; Mic 3:5; Mt 22:15-18 mischief. 7:14; 10:7,14; 36:4; 52:1; Pr 26:23-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-4","title":"Psalms 28:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Give. 5:10; 59:12,13; 69:22-24; Jer 18:21-23; 2Ti 4:14; Re 18:6 and. 2:1-5; 21:10; Eze 38:10 the work. 62:12; 103:10; 109:17-21; 103:3,4; Ro 2:6-8; 11:22 render. Ezr 9:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-5","title":"Psalms 28:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Because. 10:5; 92:4-6; 104:24; 111:2-4; Job 34:26,27; Isa 5:12; 22:11 Isa 26:9-11; Ho 14:9; Joh 12:37; Ro 1:20,28 operation. 8:3; 19:1,2; Nu 23:23; Isa 40:26; 45:8,12,18; Jer 10:12,13 Eph 1:19-21 not build. 2Sa 7:13,27; 1Ki 11:38; Jer 31:4; 32:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-6","title":"Psalms 28:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>31:21,22; 66:19,20; 69:33,34; 107:19-22; 116:1,2; 118:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-7","title":"Psalms 28:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>strength. 8; 18:1,2; 19:14; 46:1; Isa 12:2; 45:24; Eph 6:10 shield. 84:11; 91:4; Ge 15:1 heart. 13:5; 22:4; 56:3,4; 118:6-9,13-15 therefore. 16:9-11; 21:1; 30:11,12; 33:21; 68:3,4; Isa 61:10 with. 96:1-3; Ex 15:1-21; Jud 5:1-31; 1Sa 2:1-11; 2Sa 22:1-51; Re 5:9 Re 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-8","title":"Psalms 28:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>their. or, his. saving strength. Heb. strength ofsalvations. his. 2:2; 20:6; 1Sa 16:13; Isa 61:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-28-9","title":"Psalms 28:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Save. 14:7; 25:22; 80:14-19; Jer 31:7 bless. De 9:29; 2Sa 21:3; 1Ki 8:51,53; Jer 10:16; Eph 1:18 feed. or, rule. 78:71; 2Sa 7:7; Isa 40:11; Eze 34:23,24; Mic 5:2,4; 7:14 Mt 2:6; *marg: lift. Ezr 1:4; *marg:</p>"}]}